cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or discuss MAWRID, please cite this repository."
title: "MAWRID: Ablution Water for Campus Irrigation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Team"
    given-names: "MAWRID"
abstract: "A concept-stage campus system for treating source-separated ablution water toward landscape irrigation, with an independent reuse controller, proposed filtration and disinfection, and an evidence-led comparison of optional date-palm-derived adsorption media. The repository includes an illustrative browser explorer and a validation plan, not measured treatment results."
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-31
license: MIT
keywords:
  - greywater
  - water reuse
  - ablution water
  - biochar
  - date palm
  - decentralized treatment
  - campus irrigation
  - Saudi Arabia
